n=16 LRC antipodal/fan proof search (codex-2026-05-31 S392)
Exact Fraction arithmetic; threshold=1/16; k=15 speeds.

1. Antipodal pair quotient
   For n=16, split the speeds into E=even and O=odd.
   A full open cover implies the half-circle pair cover
       F_E OR (F_O AND tau(F_O))
   has no open or boundary gap, where tau is t -> t+1/2.
   This is exact: even speeds are half-turn invariant; each odd
   speed is one-sided on an antipodal pair.

